<title>FRANCE: French January coffee imports rose yr/yr.</title>
<headline>French January coffee imports rose yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>French coffee imports in January issued by French customs included (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>- coffee not roasted not decaffeinated -</p>
<p>		   Jan 97	  Jan 96	    Jan/Dec 96</p>
<p>Ivory Coast    1,523	   2,603		46,847</p>
<p>Cameroon	   412	     358		15,781</p>
<p>Brazil	   6,564	   4,202		44,649</p>
<p>Colombia	 3,019	   3,688		33,443</p>
<p>World total   29,217	  25,364	     314,490</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
